 "remarks": "A complete 'WOW' in the desirable walk-to-town River Ridge community. Spectacular views, and so many high-level upgrades to this unit (no expense was spared) including: craftsman's millwork/coffered ceilings, inlaid floors, butler's pantry with marble countertops, custom kitchen upgrades with Thermador, Wolf, Sub-zero appliances and specialty-coated Carrera marble countertops, designer lower level entertaining kitchen and family room, radiant heat in Primary Bath, mirrored home gym, heated garage, bluestone patio with awning and new stone retaining/sitting wall, generator, Sonos system and more. Celebrity designer's touches everywhere in the fabrics, lighting, millwork and overall aesthetic. This one is over-the-top gorgeous, pristine and exceptional. A dream lifestyle, just minutes from town, 2 minutes walk to Schenk's Island and Bradley Park, 15 minute drive to SoNo train, and 3 minutes to NRVT hiking trails. Don't wait to see it!",
